  "note": "Extracted by hand from the ordering schematic. The head runs model dash size dash material and connection type dash optional finish, the last left blank for the standard 20 Ra, the empty-code device. The body feature pairs a Cv and connection size letter with a port letter, and nearly every later section carries a printed Cv bracket, all enforced against that letter: the o-rings and diaphragms split at 5 Cv, the trim seats name their Cv, the 5-20 range and the two EN10204 certs keep their brackets. The NPT thread finish note rides the note: threads are not 20 Ra and cavity bottoms are machine finish only. The inlet gauge codes print slashed zero glyphs, carried as plain zeros.",
